SDK source lands here in Sprint 01.

Planned structure:
  src/
    engine/          Trainer class, event bus, lifecycle
    schema/v1.ts     Zod content schema (Sprint 02)
    adapters/
      analytics/     Interface + console impl
      persistence/   Interface + localStorage impl
    theme/           CSS variables, default theme
    index.ts         Public exports

See docs/architecture.md for the public API sketch.
